-                      text run at (0,20) width 422: "season (1959), he was also MVP in 1966 through 1968. He led the"
-                      text run at (0,40) width 412: "NBA in scoring seven straight seasons, 1960 to 1966, and led the"
-                      text run at (0,60) width 268: "league in rebounding 11 of his 14 seasons."
-                  LayoutBlockFlow {P} at (0,428) size 440x60
-                    LayoutText {#text} at (0,0) size 439x59
-                      text run at (0,0) width 439: "One of his most famous records is the 100 points he scored in a single"
-                      text run at (0,20) width 426: "game in the Philadelphia Warriors' 169-147 defeat of the New York"
-                      text run at (0,40) width 266: "Knicks on March 2, 1962, in Hershey, Pa."
